---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_NAMES } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Contact ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}: a pay figure, a pension rule, the widget`} description="Write to Pay Band Calc when a take-home figure differs from your payslip, when a pay scale or pension tier is out of date, or to embed the NHS pay calculator on your site." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Contact' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. A person reads every message.</p>
    <h2>Our figure differs from your payslip</h2>
    <p>Tell us the nation, your band and step or pay point, your hours, your pension scheme and the line that differs. The usual reasons are a tax code other than the standard one, a part month, unsocial hours or arrears paid in that month, a salary sacrifice scheme, or a pension tier your employer set on different pay. If a published scale or tier table has changed, we update the parameter file, rerun the tests and date the change.</p>
    <h2>What we cannot do</h2>
    <p>We cannot see your payslip, your pension record or your tax account, change your pay, or speak to your employer, NHSBSA, Teachers’ Pensions or HMRC for you. Please do not send your National Insurance number, your pension reference or your address. For your own pay, your payroll team is the first stop; for your pension, your Total Reward Statement or your Teachers’ Pensions account; for tax, your HMRC personal tax account.</p>
    <h2>Using the calculator on your own site</h2>
    <p>Union branches, staff networks and careers advisers can show the NHS take-home calculator in an iframe at no cost. The code and the conditions are on the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
